{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead your army and forge an empire in intense third-person real-time battles.</strong> Face dynamic environments with varying difficulty levels that will test your tactical skills. Adapt your strategy, command your troops, and claim victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Army customization:</strong> Choose your troops, customize their colors, and design your banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/armyCustomization.gif?t=1742574906\" />\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Hero customization:</strong> Modify your hero's appearance and stats to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/BannerboundHeroCustom.gif?t=1742574906\" />\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Unlock new units and gear:</strong> Win battles to gain access to better troops and equipment.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategy and formations:</strong> Plan the positioning and formation of your troops to gain a tactical advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/BannerboundFormation.gif?t=1742574906\" />\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Siege and fortress defense:</strong> Capture the enemy\u2019s flag to take control of their economy, but be prepared to defend your own stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/BannerboundConquest.gif?t=1742574906\" />\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Siege weaponry:</strong> Adapt to challenging battlefields by deploying powerful war machines to turn the tide of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea